====== PGDay 2009 ======

~~NOTOC~~

===== In a few words =====

Here's a short description of the event :

  * Date: 6-7 november 2009
  * City: Paris 
  * Venue: [[http://wiki.postgresql.fr/en:pgday2009:cr_visite_telecomparistech|Paristech Telecom]]
  * Duration: 2 days
  * How many people attended : between 200 and 300
  * Entrance will not be free
  * Contents: 1 track in french + 1 track in english (+ another on in english on saturday)
  * 1 dev room
  * food is included (cold meal)

